Modified files

packer/templates/win_server_2025_dc_packer_template.json and
packer/templates/win_desktop_11_23h2_packer_template.json are modified copies of the
citrix-packer-tools templates azure/v2507/win_server_2025_dc_packer_template.json and
azure/v2507/win_desktop_11_23h2_packer_template.json (commit 2d3a906). They were changed to:
- publish a specialized Azure Compute Gallery image version instead of a managed image;
- build on a Trusted Launch VM with Secure Boot and vTPM on;
- choose the marketplace SKU and version per build (Gen2 SKUs by default);
- download the VDA and Optimizer with a managed identity and check their SHA-256 and
  Authenticode signer before running them;
- sign in with the Azure CLI by default, and optionally build in a private network;
- use forward-slash paths and quote the installer paths.

The citrix-packer-tools scripts the templates run (install-vda.ps1, run-optimizer.ps1,
install-browser-chrome.ps1, install-browser-firefox.ps1, run-cleanup.ps1) are not copied
into this repository: 02-build.ps1 clones citrix-packer-tools at a pinned commit and runs
them unchanged.
